      "type": "explain",
      "title": "Nach der / die / das",
      "body": "Nominative singular + acc. fem./neut.: -e. Otherwise: -en.\n\n*Deutsch:* Nominativ Singular + Akk. fem./neutr.: -e. Sonst: -en.\n\n## Pattern\n\nder/die/das + Adjektiv-**e** · den/dem/den + Adjektiv-**en**",
      "examples": [
        {
          "learning": "Der neue Kollege ist sehr nett.",
          "known": "The new colleague is very nice."
        },
        {
          "learning": "Ich nehme die rote Jacke.",
          "known": "I'll take the red jacket."
        }
      ]
    },
